#. Chiptune library block
msgid "tom for _ ms pitch shifted by _ on pin _"
msgstr "tambor durante _ ms con tono desplazado por _ en el pin _"

#. Settings menu option
msgid "advanced mode"
msgstr "modo avanzado"

#. Settings menu tooltip
msgid "show advanced blocks, menu items and editor functionalities"
msgstr ""
"muestra bloques, opciones de menú y funcionalidades de edición avanzadas"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Reports firmware version loaded on the board."
msgstr "Reporta la versión del firmware cargado en la placa."

#. Library folder
msgid "folder;Motors"
msgstr "Motores"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the microseconds since the given start microseconds. Handles clock wrap."
msgstr "Reporta los microsegundos desde el momento de inicio especificado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the milliseconds since the given start milliseconds. Handles clock wrap."
msgstr "Reporta los milisegundos desde el momento de inicio especificado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Write a byte to the pin at the specified baud rate."
msgstr "Envía un byte por el pin con la tasa de baudios especificada."

#. Library folder
msgid "folder;WorkInProgress"
msgstr "En construcción"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the seconds since power up."
msgstr "Reporta los segundos desde que se encendió la placa."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Reports the three-letter BLE ID of the board if it supports BLE."
msgstr ""
"Reporta el identificador BLE de tres caracteres de la placa, si soporta BLE."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Set the SPI clock speed, mode, channel (Raspberry Pi only), and bit order."
msgstr ""
"Ajusta la velocidad del reloj, modo, canal (solo para Raspberry Pi) y orden "
"de bits del bus SPI."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte array to the serial port, starting at the given byte."
msgstr ""
"Envía una lista de bytes por el puerto serie, empezando por el byte "
"especificado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Run when the given message is received as a broadcast."
msgstr "Ejecuta cuando se reciba el mensaje especificado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the given argument or defaultValue if the argument was not supplied by the caller."
msgstr ""
"En una función, reporta el argumento indicado por el índice, o un valor por "
"defecto si este argumento no se ha proporcionado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Convert a value to the given data type."
msgstr "Convierte un valor al tipo de datos especificado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "If the condition is (-o) report the first alternative otherwise report the second alternative."
msgstr ""
"Si la condición es (-o) reporta la primera alternativa, si no, reporta la "
"segunda alternativa."

#. Language menu item. Takes the user to documentation about adding a missing language
msgid "Missing language?"
msgstr "¿Falta un idioma?"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Reports (-o) if a BLE client is connected."
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si hay un cliente BLE conectado."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Reports (-o) if the board is connected to IDE."
msgstr "Reporta (-o) si la placa está conectada a la IDE."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Map a value in the \"from\" range to the corresponding value in the \"to\" range."
msgstr ""
"Transforma un número desde su rango original hasta su valor correspondiente "
"en otro rango."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a list containing the given range of numbers (with optional increment). Useful in \"for\" loops."
msgstr ""
"Reporta una lista que contiene el rango de números definido (con incremento "
"opcional). Útil en bucles \"por\"."

