msgid "This block is still being used in"
msgstr "Blok ini masih digunakan dalam"

#. MicroBlocks IDE block deletion error message.
msgid "scripts or functions."
msgstr "skrip atau fungsi."

#. MicroBlocks IDE error message.
msgid "The board is not responding."
msgstr "Papan tidak merespons."

#. MicroBlocks IDE information
msgid "Try to Install MicroBlocks on the board?"
msgstr "Coba Instal MicroBlocks di papan?"

#. MicroBlocks IDE information
msgid "The MicroBlocks in your board is not current"
msgstr "MicroBlocks di papan Anda tidak mutakhir"

#. MicroBlocks IDE information
msgid "Try to update MicroBlocks on the board?"
msgstr "Coba perbarui MicroBlocks di papan?"

#. MicroBlocks IDE information
msgid "The firmware on the board is not compatible with this version of MicroBlocks."
msgstr "Firmware pada papan tidak kompatibel dengan versi MicroBlocks ini."

#. MicroBlocks doesn't need a translation, does it?
