msgstr "ingebouwde bibliotheek"

#. String in file picker and library dialogs
msgid "Dependency path, name or URL?"
msgstr "Afhankelijkheid pad, naam, of URL?"

#. String in file picker and library dialogs
msgid "If you are adding a library that's built into MicroBlocks, you can just enter its name."
msgstr "Als je een bibliotheek toe wil voegen die ingebouwd is in MicroBlocks dan hoef je enkel de naam in te voeren."

#. String in file picker and library dialogs
msgid "If your library is in the Libraries folder in your local MicroBlocks project folder, you need to prefix it with a slash (/)."
msgstr "Als je bibliotheek zich in de Bibliotheek map van je lokale MicroBlocks project map bevindt, dan moet je het laten vooraf gaan door een slash (/)."

#. String in file picker and library dialogs
msgid "If the library is hosted online, please input its full URL."
msgstr "Als de bibliotheek online staat, geef dan de hele URL op."

#. String in file picker and library dialogs
msgid "Tag name?"
msgstr "Tag naam?"

#. String in file picker and library dialogs
msgid "user library"
msgstr "gebruikers bibliotheek"

#. String in file picker and library dialogs
msgid "Add Library"
msgstr "Bibliotheek toevoegen"

#. the %1 tag should be kept intact. Seconds remaining for a process to finish.
msgid "%1 seconds remaining"
msgstr "%1 resterende seconden"

#. Block size button tooltip
msgid "Decrease block size"
msgstr "Maak de blokgrootte kleiner"

#. Block size button tooltip
msgid "Restore block size to 100%"
msgstr "Herstel de blokgrootte naar 100%"

#. Block size button tooltip
msgid "Increase block size"
msgstr "Maak de blokgrootte groter"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Button"
msgstr "Knop"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Boolean Input"
msgstr "Booleaanse input"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
msgid "[l] toggle value, or drop a reporter into it."
msgstr "[l] wissel de waarde of zet er een reporter blok in."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Color Input"
msgstr "Kleur input"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
msgid "[l] change the color, or drop a reporter into it."
msgstr "[l] verander de kleur of zet er een reporter blok in."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Input"
msgstr "Input"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
msgid "[l] edit its value, or drop a reporter into it."
msgstr "[l] bewerk de waarde of zet er een reporter blok in."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Block Extension"
msgstr "Blok uitbreiden"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
msgid "[l] right arrow to show optional inputs, left arrow to hide."
msgstr "[l] rechter pijl om extra inputs te laten zien, linker pijl of ze te verbergen."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Command Block"
msgstr "Commando blok"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Hat Block"
msgstr "Hat blok"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
#. The [r] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the right button pressed
msgid "[l] to run, or drag to build scripts. [r] menu."
msgstr "[l] om uit te voeren of te slepen om scripts te bouwen. [r] menu."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Reporter Block"
msgstr "Reporter blok"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
#. The [r] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the right button pressed
msgid "[l] to see value, or drop into an input slot. [r] menu."
msgstr "[l[ om de waarde te zien of neer te zetten in een input opening. [r] menu."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Script"
msgstr "Script"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
#. The [r] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the right button pressed
msgid "[l] to run. [r] menu."
msgstr "[l] om uit te voeren. [r] menu."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Pane Divider"
msgstr "Paneel verdeler"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Drag to change pane width."
msgstr "Sleep om paneel breedte te veranderen."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Library"
msgstr "Bibliotheek"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
#. The [r] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the right button pressed
msgid "[l] to show the blocks in this library. [r] menu."
msgstr "[l] om de blokken in deze bibliotheek te laten zien. [r] menu."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Block Category"
msgstr "Blok categorie"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [l] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the left button pressed
msgid "[l] to show the blocks in this category."
msgstr "[l] om de blokken in deze categorie te laten zien."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Palette"
msgstr "Palet"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Drag blocks from here to build scripts. Drop scripts here to delete them."
msgstr "Sleep blokken vanuit hier om scripts te maken. Zet scripts hier neer om ze te verwijderen."

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
msgid "Scripts Pane"
msgstr "Script paneel"

#. Tip Bar label or text (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered element)
#. The [r] tag turns into an icon of a mouse with the right button pressed
msgid "Drag blocks here to build scripts. [r] menu."
msgstr "Sleep blokken naar hier om scripts te maken. [r] menu."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Turn the user LED on or off."
msgstr "Zet de gebruikers LED aan of uit."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Display a bubble showing the value."
msgstr "Laat een textballon met de waarde zien."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Graph the value."
msgstr "Maak een grafiek van de waarde."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Report the state of button A ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Laat de status van knop A zien ( (-o) or (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Report the state of button B ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Laat de status van knop B zien ( (-o) or (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the milliseconds since the timer was last reset."
msgstr "Laat de milliseconden zien vanaf de laatste keer dat de timer was gereset."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Reset the timer."
msgstr "Reset de timer."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the seconds since power up."
msgstr "Laat het aantal seconden zien sinds het opstarten."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the milliseconds since power up."
msgstr "Laat het aantal milliseconden zien sinds het opstarten."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the microseconds since power up."
msgstr "Laat het aantal microseconden zien sinds het opstarten."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the board type."
msgstr "Geef het board type."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Reports firmware version loaded on the board."
msgstr "Geeft aan welke firmwareversie op het board is geladen."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Reports the three-letter BLE ID of the board if it supports BLE."
msgstr ""
"Geeft de drieletterige BLE-ID van het board door als het BLE ondersteunt."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Reports (-o) if a BLE client is connected."
msgstr "Geeft (-o) als een BLE-client is verbonden."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the milliseconds since the given start milliseconds. Handles clock wrap."
msgstr ""
"Geef de milliseconden sinds de opgegeven startmilliseconden. Verwerkt "
"klokomslag."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the microseconds since the given start microseconds. Handles clock wrap."
msgstr ""
"Geef de microseconden sinds de gegeven startmicroseconden. Verwerkt "
"klokomslag."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Reports (-o) if the board is connected to IDE."
msgstr "Geef (-o) als het board verbonden is met de IDE."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Report the electrical logic level on a digital pin ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Geef het elektrische logische niveau op een digitale pin ( (-o) of (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a number proportional to the voltage on an analog pin (0 = ground, 1023 = supply voltage)."
msgstr "Geef een getal dat evenredig is met de spanning op een analoge pin (0 = aarde, 1023 = toevoerspanning)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Turn a pin on or off ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Zet een pin aan of uit ( (-o) or (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Pulse width modulate (PWM) a pin with the given duty cycle (0 - 1023)."
msgstr "Pulsbreedte moduleren (PWM) van een pin met de opgegeven inschakelduur (0 - 1023)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report number of analog pins on this device."
msgstr "Geef het aantal analoge pinnen op dit apparaat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report number of digital pins on this device."
msgstr "Geef het aantal digitale pinnen op dit apparaat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the value of a register (0-255) of an I2C device (0-127)."
msgstr "Geef de waarde van een register (0-255) van een I2C-apparaat (0-127)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Set an I2C device and register to given value (0-255)."
msgstr "Maak een I2C-apparaat en -register een gegeven waarde (0-255)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Receive multiple bytes from an I2C device."
msgstr "Ontvang meerdere bytes van een I2C apparaat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send multiple bytes to an I2C device."
msgstr "Stuur meerdere bytes naar een I2C apparaat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte (0-255) to an SPI device."
msgstr "Stuur een byte (0-255) naar een SPI apparaat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Read a byte from an SPI device while sending a zero byte. Report the byte received."
msgstr "Lees een byte van een SPI apparaat terwijl je een nul byte verstuurt. Geef de ontvangen byte."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Set the SPI clock speed, mode, channel (Raspberry Pi only), and bit order."
msgstr ""

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte array via SPI, replacing its contents with the bytes received."
msgstr "Zend een byte-array via SPI, waarbij de inhoud wordt vervangen door de ontvangen bytes."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Open the serial port at the given baud rate."
msgstr "Open de seriële poort met de opgegeven baudrate."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Close the serial port."
msgstr "Sluit de seriële poort."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report data received from the serial port (a byte array)."
msgstr "Geef de gegevens ontvangen van de seriële poort (een byte-array)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte array to the serial port."
msgstr "Zend een byte-array naar de seriële poort."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Send a byte array to the serial port, starting at the given byte."
msgstr ""

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Write a byte to the pin at the specified baud rate."
msgstr ""

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Run when the board powers up or when the IDE start button is clicked."
msgstr "Uitvoeren wanneer het bord wordt ingeschakeld of wanneer op de IDE-startknop wordt geklikt."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Run when buttons A, B, or A+B are pressed."
msgstr "Uitvoeren wanneer knoppen A, B of A+B worden ingedrukt."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks indefinitely."
msgstr "Herhaal de ingesloten blokken voor altijd."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks the given number of times."
msgstr "Herhaal de ingesloten blokken het opgegeven aantal keer."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Wait the given number of milliseconds."
msgstr "Wacht het aantal opgegeven milliseconden."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Run the first set of blocks whose test condition is (-o) ."
msgstr "Uitvoeren van de eerste reeks blokken met als testvoorwaarde (-o) ."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Run when the condition becomes (-o) ."
msgstr "Uitvoeren wanneer de conditie (-o) wordt."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Wait until the condition becomes (-o) ."
msgstr "Wacht totdat de conditie (-o) wordt."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Return (report) the given value from a function or script."
msgstr "Meld de gegeven waarde uit een functie of script."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Run when the given message is received as a broadcast."
msgstr ""

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Broadcast the given message."
msgstr "Verstuur het opgegeven bericht."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Do nothing. Used to add notes and documentation."
msgstr "Doe niks. Wordt gebruikt om opmerkingen en documentatie toe te voegen."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a list containing the given range of numbers (with optional increment). Useful in \"for\" loops."
msgstr ""

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks with the variable set to the current iteration number or item."
msgstr "Herhaal de ingesloten blokken met de variabele ingesteld op het huidige iteratienummer of item."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Repeat the enclosed blocks until the condition becomes (-o) ."
msgstr "Herhaald de ingesloten blokken totdat de conditie (-o) wordt."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Stop this task."
msgstr "Stop deze taak."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Stop all tasks except this one."
msgstr "Stop alle taken behalve deze."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Wait the given number of microseconds."
msgstr "Wacht het opgegeven aantal microseconden."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the last broadcast message received."
msgstr "Geef het laatst ontvangen bericht."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the given argument or defaultValue if the argument was not supplied by the caller."
msgstr ""

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Call the function with the given name and optional parameter list."
msgstr "Roep de functie aan met de gegeven naam en optionele parameterlijst."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Call the function with the given name and optional parameter list and report its return value."
msgstr "Roep de functie met de gegeven naam en optionele parameterlijst aan en geefde retourwaarde."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the sum of the given numbers."
msgstr "Geef de som van de gegeven nummers."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the first number minus the second."
msgstr "Geef het resultaat van het eerste nummer min het tweede."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the product of the given numbers."
msgstr "Geef het resultaat van de gegeven nummers."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the first number divided by the second."
msgstr "Geef het resultaat van het eerste nummer gedeeld door het tweede."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the remainder of dividing the first number by the second."
msgstr "Geef de rest van het delen van het eerste getal door het tweede."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the absolute value of the given number (always >= 0)."
msgstr "Geef de absolute waarde van het gegeven getal (altijd >= 0)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the minimum of the values."
msgstr "Geef de laagste waarde zien."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the maximum of the values."
msgstr "Geef de grootste waarde."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a randomly chosen number in the given range."
msgstr "Geef een willekeurig gekozen nummer binnen het opgegeven bereik."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is less than the second one."
msgstr "Geef (-o) als de eerste waarde kleiner is dan de tweede."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is less than or equal to the second one."
msgstr "Geef (-o) als de eerste waarde kleiner of gelijk is aan de tweede."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the two values are equal."
msgstr "Geef (-o) als de twee waarden gelijk zijn."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the two values are not equal."
msgstr "Geef (-o) als de twee waarden niet gelijk zijn."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is greater than or equal to the second one."
msgstr "Geef (-o) als de eerste waarde groter of gelijk is aan de tweede."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if the first value is greater than the second one."
msgstr "Geef (-o) als de eerste waarde groter is dan de tweede."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Boolean constant ( (-o) or (o-) )."
msgstr "Booleaanse constante ( (-o) or (o-) )."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
#. The (o-) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to off, or false (red)
msgid "Report the logical inverse of a Boolean ( (-o) or (o-) ) value."
msgstr "Geef de logische tegenpool van een Booleaanse ( (-o) of (o-) ) waarde."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if both values are (-o)"
msgstr "Geef (-o) als beide waren (-o) zijn"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if either value is (-o)"
msgstr "Geef (-o) als een van de waardes (-o) is"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "Report (-o) if first input is a value of the given data type."
msgstr "Geef (-o) als de eerste invoer een waarde is van het gegevenstype."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Convert a value to the given data type."
msgstr "Converteer een waarde naar het opgegeven gegevenstype."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
#. The (-o) tag turns into an icon of a boolean input set to on, or true (green)
msgid "If the condition is (-o) report the first alternative otherwise report the second alternative."
msgstr ""
"Als de voorwaarde (-o) is, rapporteer dan het eerste alternatief. Anders "
"rapporteer je het tweede alternatief."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Map a value in the \"from\" range to the corresponding value in the \"to\" range."
msgstr ""

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the numerical value of a hexadecimal string (range: -0x1FFFFFFF to 0x1FFFFFFF)"
msgstr "Geef de numerieke waarde van een hexadecimale string (bereik: -0x1FFFFFFF tot 0x1FFFFFFF)"

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise AND of two numbers."
msgstr "Geef de bitgewijze AND van twee nummers."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise OR of two numbers."
msgstr "Geef de bitgewijze OR van twee nummers."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise XOR (exclusive OR) of two numbers."
msgstr "Geef de bitgewijze XOR (exclusive OR) van twee nummers."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report bitwise inverse of the given number."
msgstr "Geef de bitgewijze inverse van het gegeven getal."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the given number shifted left by the given number of bits."
msgstr "Geef het gegeven getal links verschoven met het gegeven aantal bits."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the given number shifted right by the given number of bits (arithmetic shift; sign is maintained)."
msgstr ""
"Geef het gegeven getal rechts verschoven met het gegeven aantal bits ("
"rekenkundige verschuiving; teken blijft behouden)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Set a variable to the given value."
msgstr "Geef een variabele de opgegeven waarde."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Change a variable by the given amount."
msgstr "Verander een variabele met de gegeven waarde."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Create a variable local to the containing script with the given initial value."
msgstr "Maak een lokale variabele in het script met de opgegeven beginwaarde."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the Nth item of a list, string, or byte array."
msgstr "Geef het N-de item van een lijst, tekenreeks of een byte-array."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the number of items in a list, string, or byte array."
msgstr "Geef het aantal items in een lijst, tekenreeks of byte array."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Join (concatenate) the given lists, strings, or byte arrays and report the result."
msgstr "Voeg de opgegeven lijsten, tekenreeksen of byte arrays samen en geef het resultaat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Create and report a short list containing the given items. Length limited by available stack space."
msgstr "Maak en geef een korte lijst met de gegeven items. Lengte beperkt door beschikbare stapelruimte."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Add an item to the end of a list."
msgstr "Voeg een item toe aan het einde van een lijst."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Replace the Nth item (or all items) of a list or byte array with the given value."
msgstr "Vervang het N-de item (of alle items) van een lijst of byte-array door de gegeven waarde."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Delete the Nth item (or all items) of a list."
msgstr "Verwijder het N-de item (of alle items) van een lijst."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Find and report the index of an item in a list or a substring within a string. Report -1 if not found."
msgstr "Vind en geef de index van een item in een lijst of een substring in een string. Geef -1 indien niet gevonden."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a copy from the given index through the end (or optional stop index) of the given list, string, or byte array."
msgstr "Geef een kopie vanaf de opgegeven index tot het einde (of optionele stopindex) van de opgegeven lijst, tekenreeks of byte-array."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Split the given string with the given delimiter and report the result (a list of strings)."
msgstr "Splits de gegeven tekenreeks met het gegeven scheidingsteken en geef het resultaat (een lijst van tekenreeksen)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Combine the items of a list into a string, optionally separated by a delimiter (e.g. comma)."
msgstr "Combineer de items van een lijst in een tekenreeks, optioneel gescheiden door een scheidingsteken (bv. komma)."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the Unicode value (\"code point\") of the Nth character of the given string."
msgstr "Geef de Unicode-waarde (\"codepunt\") van het N-de teken van de gegeven string."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a string containing the given Unicode value (\"code point\") or list of values."
msgstr "Geef een tekenreeks door, die de gegeven Unicode-waarde (\"codepunt\") of lijst van waarden bevat."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a new list of the given length filled with zero or the optional value."
msgstr "Geef een nieuwe lijst van de gegeven lengte, gevuld met nul of de optionele waarde."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a new byte array of the given length filled with zero or the optional value."
msgstr "Geef een nieuwe byte-array van de gegeven lengte, gevuld met nul of de optionele waarde."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report a byte array containing the UTF-8 bytes of the given string."
msgstr "Geef een byte-array met de UTF-8 bytes van de gegeven string."

#. Tip Bar text for a block (at the bottom of the IDE, gives info on the currently hovered block or input)
msgid "Report the number of words of memory available. Stop button frees up memory."
msgstr "Geef het aantal beschikbare woorden geheugen aan. Stoptoets maakt geheugen vrij."

#. Language menu item. Takes the user to documentation about adding a missing language
