#. only translate "gate _" as in a synthesizer sound gate that can be triggered
msgid "#SVG#wave-triangle gate _"
msgstr "#எச்.வி.சி#அலை-முக்கோண வாயில் _"

#. Analog Synthesis library block
#. only translate "gate _" as in a synthesizer sound gate that can be triggered
